h.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-21T19:21:39-08:00","id":1425437,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>baakyocalder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1422409-what-was-your-first-wod-game?p=1422466#post1422466\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Mage: the Ascension 1st edition.</div> </div> </div> </div>Me too. I had heard of Vampire and Werewolf back in '91 and '92; but neither of them interested me. Mage was a different matter: I bought it the moment it hit the shelves, and collected the entire series as it progressed. In fact, the only reason why I no longer have my collection is because a fellow Mage fan had <i>his</i> collection stolen; so I donated mine to him. <br /> <br /> I've subsequently taken advantage of DrivethruRPG sales to pick up everything they have that's Mage-related in PDF, so the \u201closs\u201d of my physical copies isn't that big of a deal \u2014 especially since for several years there, I was stuck in a situation where I had to put all of my worldly possessions other than my mobile devices in storage; so PDF has been much better for me than the Dead Tree editions. <br /> <br /> <hr /><br /> The second World of Darkness game that I got into was, technically, Wraith 1e (I bought it, too, when it first came out); but I don't really count it because it didn't really grab me, and I never really followed up on it. Changeling 1e, on the other hand, <i>did</i> grab me: the World of Darkness that I run (when I can) is primarily Mage and Changeling with Hunter and Mummy: the Resurrection elements coming in a distant third and forth.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-21T21:59:58-08:00","id":1425451,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1422409-what-was-your-first-wod-game?p=1425429#post1425429\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I don\u2019t get it...<br /> <br /> Also I haven\u2019t read the original Breedbook. Just the stuff in W20 Changing Breeds.</div> </div> </div> </div>Author is a rapist, 